# === Agent / tool 运行态（生成物，非源码）===
# .rivet: 策展子目录(knowledge/skills/plans/agents/...)保持跟踪，仅忽略纯运行态
.rivet/backups/
.rivet/vsw/
.rivet/semantic-index.json
.rivet/recovery-journal.jsonl
.rivet/presence.json
.rivet/constellation.json
# 其它无策展内容的工具目录，整目录忽略
